  "pdf_sha256": "020c8ce42595fcca7c41ebf3960599287aa83cffeb6dfb846cc0156a2b8793ef",
  "rights": "原刊本文及逐欄自讀錄字。數位原圖留於館藏與 Commons 外鏈。",
  "range": "第10面左3至第12面右6。第12面右6於為侍中止。",
  "columns": [
    {
      "locator": "10L03",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18,
      "text": "孝武昭路太后諱惠男丹陽建康人也以色貌"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L04",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 18,
      "end": 36,
      "text": "選入後宮生孝武帝拜為淑媛及年長無寵常"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L05",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 36,
      "end": 54,
      "text": "隨孝武出藩孝武即位有司奏奉尊號曰太后"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L06",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "宮曰崇憲太后居顯陽殿上於閨房之內禮敬"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L07",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 90,
      "text": "甚寡有所御幸或留止太后房內故民間咸有"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L08",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 90,
      "end": 108,
      "text": "醜聲宮掖事祕亦莫能辨也孝建二年追贈太"
    },
    {
      "locator": "10L09",
      "pdf_page": 10,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=10",
      "start": 108,
      "end": 126,
      "text": "后父興之散騎常侍興之妻餘杭縣廣昌鄉君"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R01",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 144,
      "text": "大明四年太后弟子撫軍參軍瓊之上表自陳"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R02",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 162,
      "text": "有司承旨奏贈瓊之父道慶給事中瓊之及弟"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R03",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 180,
      "text": "休之茂之並居顯職太后頗豫政事賜與瓊之"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R04",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 180,
      "end": 198,
      "text": "等財物家累千金居處器服與帝子相侔大明"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R05",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 198,
      "end": 216,
      "text": "五年太后隨上巡南豫州妃主以下並從廢帝"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R06",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 216,
      "end": 234,
      "text": "立號太皇太后明帝踐祚號崇憲太后初明帝"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R07",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 234,
      "end": 252,
      "text": "少失所生為太后所攝養撫愛甚篤及即位供"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R08",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 252,
      "end": 270,
      "text": "奉禮儀不異舊日有司奏宜別居外宮詔欲親"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11R09",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 270,
      "end": 288,
      "text": "奉晨昏盡懽閨禁不如所奏及聞義嘉難作太"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L01",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 288,
      "end": 306,
      "text": "后心幸之延上飲酒置毒以進侍者引上衣上"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L02",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 306,
      "end": 324,
      "text": "寤起以其巵上壽是日太后崩祕之喪事如禮"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L03",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 324,
      "end": 342,
      "text": "遷殯東宮題曰崇憲宮又詔述太后恩慈特齊"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L04",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 342,
      "end": 360,
      "text": "衰三月以申追遠諡曰昭皇太后葬孝武陵東"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L05",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 360,
      "end": 378,
      "text": "南號曰脩寧陵先是晉安王子勛未平巫者謂"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L06",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 378,
      "end": 396,
      "text": "宜開昭太后陵毀去梓宮以厭勝脩復倉卒不"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L07",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 396,
      "end": 414,
      "text": "得如禮上性忌慮將來致災泰始四年夏詔有"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L08",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 414,
      "end": 432,
      "text": "司曰崇憲昭太后脩寧陵地大明之世久所考"
    },
    {
      "locator": "11L09",
      "pdf_page": 11,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=11",
      "start": 432,
      "end": 450,
      "text": "卜前歲遭諸蕃之難禮從權宜未暇營改而塋"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R01",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 450,
      "end": 468,
      "text": "隧之所山原卑陋可式遵舊典以禮改創有司"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R02",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 468,
      "end": 486,
      "text": "奏請脩寧陵玄宮補葺毀壞權施油殿暫出梓"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R03",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 486,
      "end": 504,
      "text": "宮事畢即定詔可廢帝景和中又追贈興之侍"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R04",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 504,
      "end": 522,
      "text": "中金紫光祿大夫諡曰孝侯道慶光祿大夫開"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R05",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 540,
      "text": "府儀同三司諡曰敬侯道慶女為皇后以休之"
    },
    {
      "locator": "12R06",
      "pdf_page": 12,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=12",
      "start": 540,
      "end": 543,
      "text": "為侍中"
    }
  ],
